  "title": "packet-fr: Register for SLL dispatch to Frame Relay dissector",
  "description": "Without this patch, any Linux cooked packet capture on HDLC / frame\nrelay devices will not be dispatched to the proper dissector.\n\nSuch packets do carry a proper sll_hatype set to ARPHRD_FRAD and should\nbe dispatched accordingly.  However, the packet-fr dissector so far\ndid not register itself accordingly.\n\n[linux-sll-ethernet-and-hdlc-fr.pcapng](/uploads/e2100eca23e7f6a6dcb1179581b137bc/linux-sll-ethernet-and-hdlc-fr.pcapng)",
