          "id": 503032938,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "I've attached a file now.  It contains Ethernet/IP traffic and traffic on a total of 8  HDLC net-devices with Frame Relay on top.\n\nPlease note that this traffic is artificially generated by a test suite, so only the lower protocol layers (FR, Q.933, GPRS-NS, BSSGP) contain valid data.  The LLC payload and higher protocol data is randomized and hence many packets state that they're invalid.",
