      "title": "packet-fr: Register for SLL dispatch to Frame Relay dissector",
      "message": "packet-fr: Register for SLL dispatch to Frame Relay dissector\n\nWithout this patch, any Linux cooked packet capture on HDLC / frame\nrelay devices will not be dispatched to the proper dissector.\n\nSuch packets do carry a proper sll_hatype set to ARPHRD_FRAD and should\nbe dispatched accordingly.  However, the packet-fr dissector so far\ndid not register itself accordingly.\n",
      "author_name": "Harald Welte",
      "author_email": "laforge@osmocom.org",
      "authored_date": "2021-02-05T13:00:37.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Guy Harris",
      "committer_email": "gharris@sonic.net",
      "committed_date": "2021-02-05T21:23:43.000+00:00",
